WEBVTT

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:59.786 --> 02:01.704
Tae-sang, don't trust anyone.

02:01.788 --> 02:02.622
WINTER, 1925

02:02.705 --> 02:05.625
There is no one in this world
who can protect you.

02:05.708 --> 02:07.460
You have to fend for yourself.

02:07.544 --> 02:08.545
All right?

02:09.295 --> 02:10.922
Mother, are you going somewhere?

02:13.967 --> 02:14.884
Get inside!

02:15.510 --> 02:16.344
Hurry!

02:18.513 --> 02:19.764
Don't you ever come out!

02:19.848 --> 02:23.184
Whatever happens, whatever you may hear,
you must not come out.

02:23.268 --> 02:26.396
Hide until daybreak
and don't make a sound, all right?

02:26.980 --> 02:27.897
Mother!

02:29.190 --> 02:31.234
You must stay alive. You must!

02:32.193 --> 02:37.740
Promise me that you'll stay alive
no matter what happens, okay?

02:43.246 --> 02:44.330
Get in!

02:56.551 --> 02:59.262
Sim Sun-deok. Where's Kim Si-yeong?

03:00.597 --> 03:02.307
What are you talking about?

03:02.390 --> 03:03.600
We know everything!

03:04.392 --> 03:06.936
You're the contact for Kim Si-yeong
of the Heroic Corps.

03:08.062 --> 03:11.608
I have no clue
as to what you're talking about.

03:31.419 --> 03:32.837
You must stay alive.

03:32.921 --> 03:33.922
You must!

03:34.923 --> 03:39.344
Promise me that you'll stay alive
no matter what happens.

03:44.349 --> 03:46.809
I intend to take this seriously too,

03:46.893 --> 03:48.937
so I can survive.

03:49.020 --> 03:53.149
I don't daydream
about something like independence.

03:53.775 --> 03:56.110
All I want, in these turbulent times,

03:56.194 --> 03:58.154
is to strive as stubbornly as I can

03:58.780 --> 04:01.741
to stay alive and safe day after day.

04:06.204 --> 04:10.333
I thought I had kept my promise
to my mother pretty well.

04:10.416 --> 04:11.334
Cheers!

04:11.417 --> 04:12.794
Cheers!

04:12.877 --> 04:16.506
But then, my life started
to turn into a mess.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.675
"Until the cherry blossoms fall."

04:21.970 --> 04:23.179
It was from that moment.

04:24.138 --> 04:25.098
No.

04:25.807 --> 04:26.849
Was it then?

04:27.350 --> 04:29.936
Will you go and help the prisoners?

04:31.479 --> 04:33.940
I don't want
any more innocent people to die.

04:34.857 --> 04:38.486
I should've thought it over
before making such a promise.

04:51.958 --> 04:53.918
What? Where did everybody go?

05:14.522 --> 05:15.398
Don't move!

05:16.649 --> 05:17.567
Or we'll shoot!

05:20.445 --> 05:21.279
Run!

05:31.247 --> 05:33.124
Hey! Get up, Hui-do!

05:36.377 --> 05:38.421
Go back to where you were.

05:38.504 --> 05:40.173
Or else we'll kill you all!

05:41.966 --> 05:43.343
You son of a bitch.

05:43.426 --> 05:45.511
I said go back to your cells!

05:45.595 --> 05:47.764
Go ahead and shoot me, you fucker!

05:47.847 --> 05:48.848
Hui-do, no!

05:50.183 --> 05:53.394
What difference would it make
if I die here or out there?

05:54.103 --> 05:55.605
I'll escape even if it kills me.

05:55.688 --> 05:56.981
Just try and stop me.

05:57.648 --> 05:59.859
Shoot, you fucking sons of bitches!

06:28.971 --> 06:29.972
This way.

06:30.056 --> 06:32.392
There's a dented metal door down the way.

06:32.475 --> 06:33.935
Let's hide in there for now.

06:34.769 --> 06:36.562
Move. Come on!

06:44.070 --> 06:45.738
Hurry!

06:47.323 --> 06:48.282
Get going!

06:52.412 --> 06:53.329
Stop!

07:23.985 --> 07:26.154
That's where it all began.

07:32.285 --> 07:36.038
Once this thing enters the human body,

07:37.957 --> 07:39.500
it takes over the brain.

07:40.084 --> 07:43.546
After gaining complete control
of the brain's synapses…

07:45.965 --> 07:47.508
it begins to cause mutations.

07:47.592 --> 07:49.677
I asked you where my mother is.

07:51.053 --> 07:51.971
Answer me.

07:52.722 --> 07:53.556
Now.

07:53.639 --> 07:55.766
Ultimately, all life seeks

07:56.767 --> 07:58.853
to evolve into its strongest form.

07:59.937 --> 08:05.443
Humans, in particular,
desire to become apex predators.

08:08.988 --> 08:12.074
And this tiny organism in this cup

08:12.158 --> 08:14.368
has made that possible.

08:18.748 --> 08:19.665
Run.

08:21.959 --> 08:22.835
Run!

08:41.354 --> 08:44.398
For the time being,
it will not cease to hunt.

08:50.696 --> 08:51.906
Hui-do!

08:53.658 --> 08:58.412
Its sole instinct right now is to survive
and to have no mercy on the way.

09:09.757 --> 09:10.967
No! Don't!

09:13.052 --> 09:14.470
Hey…

10:24.040 --> 10:25.041
Help me…

10:33.341 --> 10:34.425
Damn it!

10:49.857 --> 10:50.983
Shit, come on!

11:55.256 --> 11:56.424
Please save me.

12:01.512 --> 12:02.513
Come this way.

12:24.869 --> 12:29.081
The human race will soon be greeted
with a new world.

12:29.999 --> 12:31.584
And that world

12:33.419 --> 12:35.129
was brought to us by Seishin.

12:37.465 --> 12:38.758
Your mother.

13:05.242 --> 13:08.579
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN MONSTER AND HUMAN

13:08.662 --> 13:11.248
EPISODE 6
CHAOS

13:11.332 --> 13:12.666
WOMEN DISAPPEARING IN GYEONGSEONG

13:12.750 --> 13:14.460
An interesting tip-off.

13:14.543 --> 13:16.504
So, what you're saying is,

13:17.004 --> 13:20.966
Ongseong Hospital is linked
to the missing women, and you'd like us

13:22.885 --> 13:23.719
to investigate it?

13:24.470 --> 13:26.305
This is a violent crime.

13:27.181 --> 13:29.683
If the police bureau doesn't step up,
who will?

13:29.767 --> 13:32.353
Aren't the police responsible
for Gyeongseong's safety?

13:33.729 --> 13:36.065
Ongseong Hospital
is under military jurisdiction.

13:36.148 --> 13:38.275
We can't just butt our heads in.

13:39.819 --> 13:41.195
You know better.

13:44.532 --> 13:47.535
Tae-sang, that boy,
seems to have found Myeong-ja in there.

13:49.119 --> 13:53.290
He has dragged my son in with him,
and they've gotten themselves in trouble.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.172
So,

14:01.632 --> 14:02.758
what do you want?

14:03.342 --> 14:07.012
I just want my son back safe and sound.

14:08.013 --> 14:09.181
That is all.

14:36.584 --> 14:39.837
But do you think we can really trust him?

14:40.462 --> 14:43.382
Have you ever seen me
trust anyone that easily?

14:43.465 --> 14:47.052
In fact, I don't even trust myself.

14:48.345 --> 14:51.348
But you trust
the Golden Treasure members, right?

14:51.432 --> 14:53.809
We've been to hell and back together,

14:53.893 --> 14:55.769
through thick and thin like a family!

14:56.395 --> 14:57.646
Have you ever had

14:59.064 --> 15:00.733
your nails plucked out?

15:02.526 --> 15:04.111
Have you ever been burned

15:05.112 --> 15:07.114
or gone through electric torture?

15:07.823 --> 15:11.911
I may like to gamble,
but I haven't lived life on the edge.

15:12.578 --> 15:14.580
Do you know what happens

15:16.165 --> 15:19.084
when water mixed with chili powder
is poured down your nose

15:19.627 --> 15:21.170
while hanging upside down?

15:21.253 --> 15:23.589
I don't really care to know, actually.

15:24.256 --> 15:25.466
Persist to that point,

15:27.176 --> 15:29.762
and a person can no longer remain human.

15:31.263 --> 15:33.015
If they tell you to bark, you bark,

15:34.224 --> 15:36.477
and if they tell you to crawl, you crawl.

15:38.020 --> 15:39.730
Family, comrades, or whatnot,

15:41.774 --> 15:44.485
none of them will matter anymore.

15:46.403 --> 15:48.280
Hey, you're scaring me!

15:48.364 --> 15:50.324
What's wrong with you today?

15:50.407 --> 15:52.576
What's with the random torture talk?

15:56.872 --> 15:58.916
If you're ever in such a situation,

15:59.917 --> 16:02.211
don't try to hold back and ruin your life.

16:02.795 --> 16:04.505
Just tell them everything you know.

16:05.714 --> 16:09.677
I won't ever resent you for betraying me
in a situation like that.

16:10.886 --> 16:11.887
Keep that in mind.

16:15.975 --> 16:18.811
We're running late. Let's head back now.

16:19.395 --> 16:21.105
Not like it's ever to happen,

16:22.231 --> 16:24.233
but even if I find myself
in that situation,

16:25.901 --> 16:27.528
I won't be betraying anyone.

16:28.862 --> 16:30.572
You keep that in mind, Mrs. Nawol.

18:02.664 --> 18:05.959
How long were you in there?

18:08.962 --> 18:12.549
My mother is in there too.

18:13.717 --> 18:15.302
Have you seen her?

18:16.553 --> 18:19.973
Her name is Sim Sun-deok.

18:24.103 --> 18:25.354
Do you know her?

18:33.028 --> 18:34.071
No.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.032
You haven't heard her name either?

18:38.909 --> 18:39.993
I haven't.

18:48.877 --> 18:49.711
It's cold.

18:52.131 --> 18:55.843
You should drink this and hurry home.

20:01.491 --> 20:03.160
Why didn't you keep your word?

20:04.786 --> 20:08.207
I insisted you wait there for my return,
so why didn't you?

20:10.250 --> 20:12.002
He's not coming back.

20:12.085 --> 20:15.380
Jang Tae-sang is nothing
but a lowborn bastard.

20:15.464 --> 20:18.550
A no-good filthy rogue
who only cares about money and himself!

20:19.968 --> 20:20.969
"No-good filthy rogue"?

20:21.053 --> 20:23.555
It's true that you've been one
your entire life.

20:23.639 --> 20:24.806
You turned a blind eye

20:25.724 --> 20:28.143
when Joseon fell to ruin
and your people suffered.

20:29.269 --> 20:32.481
Comrade Kwon asked you to join our group,
but you always refused.

20:33.482 --> 20:34.316
Am I wrong?

20:35.943 --> 20:37.236
Let me ask you something.

20:38.612 --> 20:41.698
Am I a bad person
if I don't align myself with your cause?

20:41.782 --> 20:44.660
You're a fence-sitter
with no clear allegiance.

20:45.869 --> 20:47.162
How can we trust you?

20:47.246 --> 20:51.458
Have you always made the right choice
with that clear allegiance of yours?

20:51.541 --> 20:52.751
All I ever wanted

20:54.253 --> 20:55.754
was to escape from this hell--

20:55.837 --> 20:58.006
Then you should have waited!

20:58.090 --> 21:00.342
You didn't know the way out.
You had no plan.

21:00.425 --> 21:03.303
Did you think getting out of your cell
was all there was to it?

21:03.387 --> 21:06.473
What will you do about those
who died for nothing in that mess?

21:06.556 --> 21:08.225
Their sacrifices were inevitable!

21:08.308 --> 21:10.727
How was it inevitable?
You didn't even try!

21:11.728 --> 21:13.355
You even had the key,

21:13.438 --> 21:15.857
but you got scared
and ran off like a coward!

21:15.941 --> 21:17.442
What are you doing? Let go of me!

21:17.526 --> 21:20.821
Stop justifying
and rationalizing your faults,

21:20.904 --> 21:23.573
your mistakes,
and your incompetence like that!

21:24.616 --> 21:26.785
You didn't even have the courage to die,

21:26.868 --> 21:30.122
so don't you dare take
the sacrifices of others for granted!

21:37.337 --> 21:39.214
I heard you were a man of conviction.

21:41.425 --> 21:43.468
Jun-taek must have been sorely mistaken.

22:17.544 --> 22:22.257
Now, let's list the names of the members
of the Patriotic Society, shall we?

22:28.096 --> 22:29.723
Start with the organization chart.

22:42.152 --> 22:43.111
Master Jang.

22:47.074 --> 22:48.158
You're alive.

22:56.124 --> 22:57.042
Are you all right?

22:58.418 --> 22:59.336
Are you injured?

23:00.170 --> 23:01.254
It's nothing serious.

23:03.799 --> 23:05.008
But Chae-ok…

23:07.386 --> 23:08.637
I don't see her here.

23:16.728 --> 23:18.063
Say it isn't true.

23:20.565 --> 23:21.608
It can't be.

23:22.192 --> 23:23.985
How is that even possible?

23:25.404 --> 23:28.407
How can a human turn into such a creature?

23:28.490 --> 23:31.159
Not just a creature.
It's an evolved being!

23:32.035 --> 23:35.789
It's become more powerful and beautiful
than the weak humans!

23:37.124 --> 23:37.958
How about it?

23:39.918 --> 23:41.670
Don't you want to try it for yourself?

23:44.381 --> 23:45.215
What?

23:45.298 --> 23:46.299
Who knows?

23:48.343 --> 23:50.303
If you mutate like your mother did,

23:51.763 --> 23:54.558
perhaps she'll recognize her baby girl.

23:55.142 --> 23:56.393
You crazy bastard!

23:59.563 --> 24:00.522
Answer me.

24:01.314 --> 24:02.274
Answer me now!

24:07.779 --> 24:08.864
That creature,

24:10.574 --> 24:12.617
tell me how it can be stopped.

24:13.201 --> 24:14.911
You can't stop it.

24:16.163 --> 24:17.080
Because…

24:19.833 --> 24:21.960
I don't want it to stop!

24:29.885 --> 24:30.802
I see.

24:33.805 --> 24:35.724
So my wife was here.

24:36.224 --> 24:38.143
She left a message on the wall,

24:38.727 --> 24:40.979
but what happened to her afterward
isn't clear.

24:41.062 --> 24:42.856
We don't know if she's still in here.

24:42.939 --> 24:45.609
And Chae-ok went to find that out?

24:49.654 --> 24:51.364
I'm sorry I couldn't stay with her

24:52.282 --> 24:53.116
until the end.

24:54.701 --> 24:55.702
Don't be.

24:57.537 --> 25:00.415
I know you are doing your part,
Master Jang.

25:01.917 --> 25:03.043
I've always known.

25:03.710 --> 25:06.213
Even though you may not act like it
on the outside,

25:06.713 --> 25:09.508
I knew you would make
the right decision in the end.

25:13.303 --> 25:15.847
You saved all these people, Master Jang.

25:25.357 --> 25:27.108
We still have a long way to go.

25:27.192 --> 25:30.070
They all need to be moved
to somewhere safe.

25:30.153 --> 25:32.697
Could you take care of them, sir?

25:44.292 --> 25:46.503
There is an emergency exit this way.

25:46.586 --> 25:48.338
Follow the stairs to the second floor.

25:48.421 --> 25:51.633
At the end of the eastern hallway,
there should be an empty ward.

25:52.217 --> 25:54.469
Tuberculosis recently spread there,

25:54.553 --> 25:55.971
so it's currently vacant.

25:56.846 --> 25:59.015
You should be able to hide
for a few hours.

25:59.599 --> 26:00.934
Is that information reliable?

26:01.017 --> 26:04.646
I paid a high price for it,
so it should be.

26:04.729 --> 26:06.481
Then what about you?

26:11.111 --> 26:14.364
I'll find Ms. Yoon,
and we'll meet you there together.

26:20.662 --> 26:22.080
Please do.

26:28.044 --> 26:29.129
Everyone.

26:29.212 --> 26:31.798
I know you're all exhausted,
but we shouldn't stay here.

26:31.881 --> 26:34.467
We'll get moving,
so prepare yourselves and follow me.

26:39.514 --> 26:40.432
Let's go.

26:48.148 --> 26:48.982
Wait.

26:52.819 --> 26:54.571
Master Jang asked me to give you this.

26:58.783 --> 27:00.285
I trust you to cover the rear.

27:28.605 --> 27:30.607
Did you call for me, Director?

27:30.690 --> 27:31.691
Idiot.

27:32.317 --> 27:33.693
Stupid idiot!

27:33.777 --> 27:34.861
You son of a bitch!

27:35.570 --> 27:38.406
Why the hell are all these doors open?

27:38.490 --> 27:40.200
Why are the cells empty?

27:40.283 --> 27:42.285
Why?

27:43.078 --> 27:43.953
Why?!

27:45.830 --> 27:48.541
Please give me some time.
I'll find out what happened and--

27:48.625 --> 27:49.793
So, you don't know?

27:50.710 --> 27:52.921
You're the one in charge here, idiot!

27:54.047 --> 27:54.964
You fool!

27:55.465 --> 27:56.466
Stupid shit!

27:57.550 --> 27:58.885
Forgive me, sir!

28:01.471 --> 28:02.847
Sir, we have a problem!

28:12.023 --> 28:12.941
What is it?

28:17.779 --> 28:21.449
Corpses infected with anthrax
have been found in the Level 2-1 area.

28:22.659 --> 28:23.702
What?

28:39.300 --> 28:40.218
And the specimen?

28:40.301 --> 28:43.722
It had already gone by the time
the disease control platoon got there.

28:49.561 --> 28:50.895
Tell me more in detail.

28:54.023 --> 28:59.988
Including the sentry who discovered it,
all 13 corpses were infected with anthrax.

29:00.071 --> 29:02.615
Nine of them
were Joseon prisoners who escaped.

29:02.699 --> 29:03.992
Where are the rest?

29:05.034 --> 29:09.456
The dead be damned.
Where are the Josenjings who are alive?

29:09.539 --> 29:12.876
Oh, my apologies, sir.
We haven't found them yet.

29:18.047 --> 29:20.800
Sir, a message has arrived
from the main gates.

29:20.884 --> 29:22.218
What is it now?

29:22.302 --> 29:23.678
Commissioner Ishikawa is here.

29:23.762 --> 29:27.849
He's requesting cooperation
in investigating the missing women cases.

29:27.932 --> 29:29.184
What?

29:31.519 --> 29:32.896
Did you hear that, Soma?

29:32.979 --> 29:35.440
Even Ishikawa has noticed
that something is off.

29:36.107 --> 29:37.442
Forgive me, sir!

29:40.862 --> 29:42.572
Sort this out immediately.

29:42.655 --> 29:43.615
Yes, sir!

29:49.412 --> 29:52.582
If even a single Josenjing
escapes the hospital,

29:52.665 --> 29:56.085
you and your family
will be imprisoned in their place.

29:57.378 --> 30:03.092
I'll personally cut out their intestines
while they are still alive.

30:04.260 --> 30:05.094
Understood?

30:07.388 --> 30:10.183
Do you understand, you goddamn moron?

30:11.017 --> 30:12.060
Yes, sir!

30:14.187 --> 30:15.522
Worthless prick.

30:31.412 --> 30:32.372
Walk faster.

30:33.456 --> 30:35.708
You and I are going to find that creature.

30:36.584 --> 30:39.796
If we do, then what?

30:39.879 --> 30:42.382
I'm going to stop it at all costs.

30:42.465 --> 30:43.800
I told you it's impossible.

30:44.509 --> 30:46.135
Then think of a way.

30:46.219 --> 30:47.387
You created it.

30:47.971 --> 30:48.847
Colonel Kato.

30:53.768 --> 30:54.686
What is it?

30:54.769 --> 30:57.105
We're currently pursuing the specimen,

30:57.188 --> 31:01.484
but I'm afraid we'll have to release
the rest of the nitrogen gas in Level Two

31:01.568 --> 31:03.361
in order to drag the creature out.

31:03.444 --> 31:07.282
What if you fail to capture it
even after you do so?

31:07.365 --> 31:10.577
That's why I'm here
to ask for your permission.

31:11.411 --> 31:14.038
If we fail to sedate the creature…

31:20.545 --> 31:21.546
You'll shoot it dead?

31:22.130 --> 31:25.133
We can't afford to lose any more men.

31:25.216 --> 31:28.970
Please give me your permission
to kill it, sir!

31:31.723 --> 31:36.227
There's only one way to kill Seishin.

31:37.103 --> 31:38.187
What is it, sir?

31:38.897 --> 31:40.189
You burn it.

31:43.234 --> 31:44.861
But do you really think

31:46.362 --> 31:47.196
you can do it?

31:48.197 --> 31:49.032
Sir?

31:49.866 --> 31:51.576
It's your mother, after all.

31:53.912 --> 31:55.455
Can you actually kill it?

31:57.040 --> 31:58.207
Shit!

32:00.585 --> 32:04.297
Her appearance may have changed,
but it's still your mother.

32:04.380 --> 32:07.800
Do you really think you can kill it?
Do you?

32:32.575 --> 32:34.577
A message from Mr. Shiro, ma'am.

33:04.190 --> 33:08.736
THE MISSION TO RESCUE AKIKO HAS BEGUN

34:50.338 --> 34:52.173
It's been a while, Director Ichiro.

34:53.216 --> 34:54.842
What brings you to our hospital?

34:55.885 --> 34:59.263
We got a tip that your hospital
was involved in the missing women cases.

34:59.347 --> 35:02.475
As you know,
the hospital is currently shut down.

35:02.558 --> 35:05.812
No outsiders are allowed to enter,
without exception.

35:05.895 --> 35:07.438
And the reason being?

35:07.522 --> 35:09.899
There is an unknown infectious disease.

35:09.982 --> 35:13.236
It's highly contagious,
so I hope you understand.

35:13.903 --> 35:15.738
You say it's highly contagious,

35:15.822 --> 35:20.076
yet I don't see any protective clothing
or equipment on you.

35:20.159 --> 35:23.371
We should also be safe, then.
Don't you think?

35:25.957 --> 35:28.167
This hospital
is under military jurisdiction.

35:28.751 --> 35:32.255
The police bureau has no authority
to investigate or control this place.

35:32.338 --> 35:33.965
Civilians have disappeared,

35:34.048 --> 35:36.592
which means the police
may intervene and investigate.

35:40.555 --> 35:43.224
Don't make me lose face
in front of my subordinates.

35:43.808 --> 35:46.727
I'm afraid we must investigate,
even as a mere formality.

35:55.153 --> 35:57.321
Please excuse us for the time being.

36:06.122 --> 36:08.624
- Move the girl somewhere else.
- Yes, sir.

36:42.408 --> 36:43.409
Put your hands up.

36:45.161 --> 36:46.078
Who are you?

36:46.162 --> 36:47.747
How did you get in here?

36:50.541 --> 36:52.543
I'm looking for someone.

36:54.879 --> 36:56.047
Where's the woman?

36:57.340 --> 36:58.925
Where's the girl that was here?

38:14.917 --> 38:17.461
Get inside. Now!

38:22.591 --> 38:25.344
Sorry to disappoint you,
but I don't have time for that.

38:25.428 --> 38:26.345
Get in there now!

38:28.347 --> 38:29.432
I told you.

38:30.308 --> 38:33.060
I don't have time to waste here with you.

39:09.805 --> 39:10.723
It's no use.

39:13.559 --> 39:15.227
Don't waste your energy.

39:15.311 --> 39:17.313
What the hell do you want?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.441
Soon

39:21.233 --> 39:24.362
your dearly missed Seishin will show up.

39:29.408 --> 39:30.951
It's been ten years, you said?

39:32.536 --> 39:35.790
I'm not sure
if your mother will recognize you.

39:39.001 --> 39:40.002
Current status?

39:40.878 --> 39:43.547
We've cornered it to ride in the elevator.

41:04.420 --> 41:05.254
Hey.

41:05.754 --> 41:06.839
Hey!

41:14.305 --> 41:17.892
It was the woman. She took my clothes.

41:17.975 --> 41:21.353
She took my clothes,
and Mr. Soma beat me--

41:22.855 --> 41:25.316
So, where is the woman now?

42:36.512 --> 42:37.346
Sergeant.

42:37.930 --> 42:39.348
What will happen to that woman?

42:40.558 --> 42:43.519
Will she die at the hands of the creature?

42:43.602 --> 42:44.937
Shut up, Josenjing.

42:45.646 --> 42:47.398
This is no place for you to talk.

42:48.732 --> 42:49.650
I'm sorry, sir.

44:10.022 --> 44:11.023
Kill her.

44:15.944 --> 44:18.030
Go on and kill her, Seishin!

44:19.490 --> 44:21.367
Devour your daughter!

44:30.167 --> 44:31.377
Go on!

44:32.336 --> 44:33.420
Mother!

45:09.998 --> 45:10.958
Mom?

45:19.383 --> 45:20.718
Is it you, Mother?

45:27.474 --> 45:29.059
Is it really you?

45:35.983 --> 45:37.025
Mother…

45:56.378 --> 45:57.796
Mother!

47:04.446 --> 47:05.405
Seize it!

47:06.281 --> 47:07.115
Seize it!

47:46.947 --> 47:48.156
Mother…

47:53.120 --> 47:54.329
Release the nitrogen gas.

47:54.413 --> 47:55.873
Release the nitrogen!

48:17.102 --> 48:18.896
- Fire!
- Fire!

50:13.844 --> 50:15.637
Halt!

50:22.769 --> 50:23.770
Where's the girl?

50:23.854 --> 50:26.732
Where's the girl? Find her!

50:30.485 --> 50:32.904
No! Let me go!

50:32.988 --> 50:34.865
- Let go!
- What's wrong with you?

50:34.948 --> 50:36.450
- Mom!
- Where are you going?

50:38.535 --> 50:39.786
Pull yourself together!

50:40.787 --> 50:43.540
Where do you think you're going?
To your own death?

50:49.087 --> 50:50.630
That was my mother.

50:56.178 --> 50:57.012
What?

51:00.766 --> 51:06.855
Those bastards turned my mother
into that creature.

51:12.235 --> 51:13.779
Please help me.

51:14.821 --> 51:16.323
Help me.

51:19.826 --> 51:21.078
Help me!

52:06.540 --> 52:07.624
Unbelievable.

52:08.667 --> 52:12.337
It withstood
all the nitrogen gas we shot at it.

52:15.465 --> 52:17.259
Could it be that the maternal instinct…

52:19.594 --> 52:21.263
conquered the Najin in the end?

52:22.139 --> 52:23.890
What should we do about the girl?

52:28.186 --> 52:29.729
Don't let her live.

52:31.690 --> 52:32.691
Yes, sir!

52:39.072 --> 52:41.241
All of you, follow me.

52:42.200 --> 52:43.785
The hunt begins now!

52:43.869 --> 52:45.036
Yes, sir!

52:59.968 --> 53:00.886
Search thoroughly!

53:32.000 --> 53:33.043
Try it.

53:33.793 --> 53:35.212
It should make you feel better.

54:06.493 --> 54:08.495
I won't ask if you're okay.

54:10.455 --> 54:13.708
Because I know you aren't.

54:18.129 --> 54:19.256
But still…

54:21.591 --> 54:23.218
I hope you'll feel better.

54:28.056 --> 54:30.725
The last words my mother spoke to me were,

54:32.102 --> 54:34.688
"You must stay alive."

54:37.482 --> 54:39.859
She told me to survive,
no matter what happens.

54:42.862 --> 54:44.948
I was nine years old then.

54:47.617 --> 54:49.828
I was too young to fully comprehend

54:51.746 --> 54:54.958
what it meant to survive
without my mother.

55:03.842 --> 55:05.719
For now, let's get out of here alive.

55:08.013 --> 55:11.057
Then let's take our time
and come up with a plan.

55:18.064 --> 55:19.733
Do you have more?

56:18.875 --> 56:19.876
Yes, sir.

57:18.768 --> 57:19.602
What are you doing?

57:22.856 --> 57:24.399
You can't park your vehicle here.

57:24.482 --> 57:26.776
I'm waiting for Commissioner Ishikawa.

57:27.485 --> 57:29.446
Plus, my back is aching. Hold on.

57:33.158 --> 57:34.742
I had a sudden craving as well.

57:34.826 --> 57:35.785
You can't drink here.

57:35.869 --> 57:38.705
Come now! Don't be so hard on yourself.

57:39.747 --> 57:42.417
What do you say?
How about a drink together?

57:43.668 --> 57:45.587
It's a chilly night,

57:45.670 --> 57:48.715
but with a sip of this,
you'll feel nice and warm.

57:48.798 --> 57:50.467
- Not allowed.
- What?

57:50.967 --> 57:51.801
Hold on.

57:56.264 --> 57:57.807
Not even champagne?

57:58.475 --> 57:59.309
Cham…

57:59.392 --> 58:00.560
Just a second.

58:03.438 --> 58:06.107
Now, come this way. Come on!

58:15.867 --> 58:16.868
How was Level Three?

58:16.951 --> 58:18.077
All clear, sir.

58:18.161 --> 58:20.288
- And Level Two?
- Nothing, sir.

58:20.371 --> 58:23.458
It seems that she may have
already escaped.

58:26.169 --> 58:29.172
Starting from now,
search the entire military ward.

58:29.255 --> 58:32.342
The underground lab, the first floor,
and even the admission ward.

58:32.425 --> 58:33.426
Yes, sir!

58:33.927 --> 58:35.011
Sergeant Haneda!

58:37.805 --> 58:38.973
You should see this.

58:42.268 --> 58:43.353
Help us.

58:44.187 --> 58:45.939
Damn it to hell.

59:01.788 --> 59:03.331
Have you searched that side?

59:03.414 --> 59:04.999
Currently underway, sir.

59:05.083 --> 59:07.168
Start searching from the ward at the end.

59:07.752 --> 59:10.171
But that's where
tuberculosis spread recently.

59:10.255 --> 59:11.297
Silence!

59:11.381 --> 59:12.799
Those are your given orders!

59:13.299 --> 59:14.217
Yes, sir.

59:46.291 --> 59:47.166
Father!

59:51.379 --> 59:52.213
Chae-ok.

59:59.137 --> 01:00:00.096
Chae-ok.

01:00:16.070 --> 01:00:17.071
Are you okay?

01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:30.293
Myeong-ja?

01:00:35.757 --> 01:00:38.760
Let us escape with you, Master Jang.
I'd like to leave too.

01:01:07.246 --> 01:01:10.249
The time allocated to us is ten minutes.

01:01:16.631 --> 01:01:19.133
We start moving at six o'clock sharp.

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:39.195
Everyone must get in the truck
within those ten minutes.

01:01:41.447 --> 01:01:43.866
What if we fail to get everyone
on board in time?

01:01:44.701 --> 01:01:45.785
What happens then?

01:01:46.911 --> 01:01:50.456
The truck will leave on time regardless.

01:01:59.799 --> 01:02:02.468
Block all entryways to the military ward.

01:02:02.552 --> 01:02:05.304
Seal off the building. Move out!

01:02:05.388 --> 01:02:06.389
Yes, sir!

01:02:09.225 --> 01:02:11.352
Are you all ready?

01:02:24.866 --> 01:02:25.742
Then,

01:02:26.659 --> 01:02:27.744
let's begin.
